  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Occasionally guns will completely stop spawning in CTF. Only shields will spawn. This happens on both sides of the map.\nStarting a new game doesn't seem to fix it either. We usually have to create a new instance. However very rarely it just fixes itself after a few minutes.\n\nNot entirely sure why it happens, but it seems to be related to the \"game start\" glitching out. Me and a few friends managed to partially reproduce it by having someone spam the start game/cancel start button while others are already in (It didn't work every time), but I'm not sure if that's the cause. It has something to do with game start for sure, though.",
